---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
// Six .mov files also live in public/images/nosfera2/ (2.7-10.5MB, unoptimized phone
// exports); video integration waits for Vimeo, so this page is stills-only for now.
---

<BaseLayout title="Sharper Teeth (AR installation)" description="An AR installation of ordinary products hiding an alternate consumerist goal, each carrying a vampire-themed label visible only through an AR filter.">
  <article class="project">

    <header class="project-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">installation · 2022</span>
      <h1 class="display-xl project-title">Sharper Teeth (AR installation)</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image">
      <img
        src="/images/nosfera2/IMG_8619.JPG"
        alt="Sharper Teeth: grocery shelf installation with AR-enabled product boxes"
        class="hero-img"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="project-body">

      <p class="lead">
        Sharper Teeth was an AR installation of ordinary products hiding an alternate consumerist goal. Each product (margarine, baking soda, dish soap, a DVD of Twilight) carried an alternate vampire-themed label, visible only through an AR filter. Point your phone at the shelf and the brands confess.
      </p>

      <p class="caption shelf-caption">
        Products included I Can't Believe It's Not Butter, Arm &amp; Hammer, Mtn Dew, Dawn, Sun-Maid raisins, and a Twilight DVD, among others.
      </p>

      <div class="image-pair">
        <div class="project-image">
          <img
            src="/images/nosfera2/IMG_8628.JPG"
            alt="Sharper Teeth: AR filter revealing a product's vampiric alternate label"
            class="content-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="project-image">
          <img
            src="/images/nosfera2/IMG_8665.JPG"
            alt="Sharper Teeth: product signage and AR filter instructions"
            class="content-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        Alongside the shelf, miniature screens embedded in custom product boxes played looping video art, our own commercials for products that don't exist. I built the AR experience, the concept, and the physical installation; the video content was made with Dream Video Division collaborators. Shown at the Overlook Film Festival, New Orleans, 2022.
      </p>

      <div class="project-image">
        <img
          src="/images/nosfera2/IMG_8685.JPG"
          alt="Sharper Teeth: installation detail"
          class="content-img"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'"
        />
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="project-meta">
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">year</span>
        <span class="meta-value">2022</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">medium</span>
        <span class="meta-value">installation: AR + physical fabrication</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">venue</span>
        <span class="meta-value">Overlook Film Festival, New Orleans · 2022</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">collaborators</span>
        <span class="meta-value">Dream Video Division (video content)</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--page-padding-x) var(--space-8);
  }

  .project-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
  .project-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .hero-image {
    background: var(--surface);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    min-height: 340px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-body {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }
  .lead {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .shelf-caption {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .project-image {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .content-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .image-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }
  .image-pair .project-image {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .project-meta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .meta-label {
    color: var(--gold);
    align-self: start;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .project {
      padding: var(--space-5) var(--page-padding-x-sm) var(--space-7);
    }
    .image-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .meta-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
